            "accordion_row_VcTr4g": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Will my bag be perfect?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_dHRmKz": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>\"perfect\" is a very subjective word. &nbsp;Will 852 build your bag to the best of our ability and give you the best product we possibly can? Yes! &nbsp;</p><p>That said, the great majority of our leathers are \"full grain genuine leather\". &nbsp;Sometimes full grain hides will have natural markings. &nbsp;I do my best to cut around these &nbsp;and can almost always place them on the underside or inside pockets so they are out of sight. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Many of the big brands have moved to \"top grain\" leather where the outer portion of the hide is sanded and buffed. &nbsp;This helps them avoid this hand selection process and makes mass production easier for them. but with top grain you lose strength, pliabilaity, natural aging.&nbsp;</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
